WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.837
- OH!
- WHAT?

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.839
- OH, MY GOSH!
- WHAT A HALF!

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.807
- THAT IS CRAZY!
- OH, MY GOD.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:09.843
- OH, MY GOSH.
- HEY, UH...

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.778
FORGOT TO TELL YA,
CONGRATULATIONS

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.446
ON GETTING THE NEW JOB.
- OH, THANKS, MAN.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.248
I APPRECIATE IT.
- AWESOME, THAT'S AWESOME.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.750
- YEAH, AND THANK YOU
FOR INVITING ME OVER HERE

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.218
TO THE GAME TODAY.
- OH, NO PROBLEM.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:19.786
I MEAN,
YOU'RE MY BEST FRIEND.

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:20.987
- WOW, THANKS, MAN.
HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.322
YOU'RE MY BEST FRIEND TOO.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:23.790
- COOL.
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.426
- WROTE A SONG ABOUT IT.
- [laughs]

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.928
- NOT GONNA SING IT OR ANYTHING,
'CAUSE THAT WOULD BE GAY.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:30.830
- [laughing]
THAT'S PRETTY GAY.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.232
- ALL RIGHT,
I'LL GIVE IT A SHOT.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:34.401
[clears throat]

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.808
♪ WALLY,
YOU'RE MY BEST FRIEND ♪

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:45.245
♪ TOGETHER WE CAN
CHANGE THE WORLD ♪

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:48.081
♪ WE'VE BEEN TOGETHER
THROUGH THICK AND THIN ♪

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:50.650
♪ PLAYING BALL
AND TALKING TO GIRLS ♪

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:54.421
♪ WALLY,
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU ♪

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:58.258
♪ YOU KNOW YOU'VE TAKEN
ALL OF MY ADVICE ♪

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.360
- WAIT, STOP, STOP, STOP,
STOP...WHAT ADVICE?

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:04.764
- OH, UM...
IT'S JUST A SONG, DUDE.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.032
I MEAN, LIKE,
CAN I FINISH?

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.300
- YEP.
- AND THEN WE CAN?

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.234
- O-OKAY.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.270
[clears throat]

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:13.173
♪ YOU'VE DONE EVERYTHING
I'VE ASKED OF YOU ♪

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.609
♪ AND YOU NEVER,
EVER QUESTIONED TWICE ♪

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.244
- WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:23.750
♪ THANK YOU FOR DOING
WHAT I TOLD YOU TO ♪

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:28.688
♪ YOUR ACHIEVEMENTS
ARE ALSO MINE ♪

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.523
♪ MY PADAWAN ♪

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.193
♪ YOU MAKE
YOUR SENSEI PROUD ♪

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.428
♪ LIVING YOUR LIFE
LIVING YOUR LIFE ♪

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.896
[low]
TWO, THREE, FOUR...

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:41.734
♪ LIVING YOUR LIFE
TO MY DESIGN ♪

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:44.737
- THAT WAS THE WEIRDEST SONG
I'VE EVER HEARD IN MY LIFE, SO--

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.474
- ♪ YOU HAVE LISTENED
TO YOUR ELDERS ♪

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.109
- I'M OLDER THAN YOU!
- ♪ NEVER FORGET ♪

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.511
♪ THE WORDS I SAY ♪
- OKAY, I, UH,

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:53.046
DON'T LIKE YOUR SONG,
SO I'M GONNA BOUNCE.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.781
- ♪ YOU ARE PRODUCT
OF MY CREATION ♪

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.917
- WHAT? NO I'M NOT.
- ♪ I HAVE SHOWN YOU THE WAY ♪

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:59.819
- EXCEPT FOR THAT YOU HAVEN'T.
YOU HAVEN'T.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.888
- ♪ MODULATE ♪

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.456
- YOU JUST SAY
WHAT YOU'RE DOING?

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.024
- ♪ LIKE THE WHITE WOLF
GUIDES HIS CUBS ♪

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.693
♪ THROUGH THE PLAINS
OF THE CARIBOU ♪

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.696
- SHUT UP!

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:15.101
- ♪ I HAVE DONE
ALL I CAN ♪

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:20.807
♪ THE REST IS UP TO ♪

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:24.177
[high]
♪ YOU ♪

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:25.712
MY WOLF CUB
IS ALL GROWN UP.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:29.249
[shudders]

